# Making the Grade (windurst 4): Tauwawa's 446 next to Windurst mission 2-2's line there (A Testing Time: 187, an Event;
# her order: default, Mission[2][4], Mission[2][20], Quest[2][4]), so a Progress and an Event line differ. A level-10
# WAR, Teacher's Pet completed, fame 125, Making the Grade accepted by GM, 2-2 current by GM. Tauwawa has no script.
lists WindurstWaters/Tauwawa/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=165.5,-1.25,161.1 job=WAR lvl=10
quest Windurst.TeachersPet completed
fame Windurst 125
quest Windurst.MakingTheGrade accepted
mission Windurst ATestingTime current
login
trigger Tauwawa                               # two Event lines: the mission's 187 first
finish
trigger Tauwawa                               # the next line: this quest's 446
finish
trigger Tauwawa                               # the cycle wraps: 187
finish
